msgctxt "1837\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Men who fight here surpass mere strength, they are the maximum!\n"
"Get ready for battles of maximum proportions like you've never\n"
"seen before! Experience the battling spirit of fighters who have\n"
"undergone countless years of intense training!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2076\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A gathering of the strongest of fighters and the finest of fights!\n"
"Watch as the curtain rises on the most dynamite grand prix around!\n"
"Which fighter will muscle their way to the top?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2258\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A new grand stage of fighting has just opened its doors! Finally,\n"
"the no-holds-barred battle you've been waiting for is here! Which\n"
"fighter will capture the wealth and fame of the fighting\n"
"underground?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2460\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A grand prix that allows weapons! Experience the impact of well-\n"
"honed and eye-catching techniques unseen in bare-handed fighting!\n"
"The apex of weapon combat has arrived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2630\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A grand prix only for selected tag fighting teams! The techniques\n"
"of these ultimate team duos are in their own class of power and\n"
"destruction! The top tag team of the Underground Coliseum will\n"
"be decided here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2840\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A new tag match grand prix! Tough veterans of the underground\n"
"fighting circuit will unite to battle together! Which team will\n"
"be able to enjoy the sweet taste of victory?"
msgstr ""
"Un nuovo Grand Prix a squadre! Duri veterani del circuito dei \n"
"combattimenti clandestini si uniranno per lottare fianco a fianco! \n"
"Quale team assaporerà il dolce gusto della vittoria?"

msgctxt "3011\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Stand up and prove your strength mano a mano with your fists!\n"
"No cheap tricks allowed in this bare fist against bare fist grand\n"
"prix! Who will punch it out to become number one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3189\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Fight for your life in this grand prix of raining bombs! Evade\n"
"countless bombs and use them against your opponents in your fight\n"
"for victory! Just who will wade through the blasts to victory!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3382\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A grand prix in a roped ring! The ring's sturdy ropes will bounce\n"
"back opponents who fly into them! Special Underground Coliseum\n"
"gloves also allow fighters to send their opponents flying further\n"
"than ever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3588\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A grand prix set upon a heated iron plate! These hot fights will\n"
"get fighters and fans alike heated up! Don't miss the hottest\n"
"battles of the Underground Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3752\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Falling out of this ring means immediate defeat! Don't drop your\n"
"guard because of the fence, or you'll get sent flying through it!\n"
"Which fighter will survive to the end?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3922\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Deadly weapons and foul play welcome! A grand prix for street\n"
"fighters set in a complete reproduction of a Kamurocho street⑬\n"
"right here in the ring! Pick up weapons off the ground and attack\n"
"for the win!"
msgstr ""
"Armi letali e colpi bassi sono i benvenuti! Un Grand Prix per veri lottatori\n"
"di strada ambientato in una fedele riproduzione di una via di Kamurocho,\n"
"proprio qui, sul ring! Raccogliete le armi da terra e\n"
"abbattete i vostri avversari per conquistare la vittoria!"

msgctxt "4128\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A gathering of Kamurocho fighters who think they've got what it\n"
"takes! A chance for rookie fighters to grab their first victory!\n"
"Don't miss a chance to see the next rising star!"
msgstr ""
"Un raduno per i lottatori di Kamurocho che pensano di avere la stoffa!\n"
"L'opportunità perfetta per i combattenti esordienti di agguantare la loro prima vittoria!\n"
"Non perdetevi l'occasione di assistere alla nascita di una nuova stella!"

msgctxt "4306\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You cannot participate in this grand prix yet."
msgstr "Non puoi ancora partecipare a questo Grand Prix."
